==Trivia==
*In ''RuneScape Classic'', the ladder in the western part of the southern sewers served as the entrance to where [[Clivet]] could be found. With the transition to ''RuneScape 2'', the entrance was moved further down the stream, along with Clivet. The western section has been inaccessible ever since. Despite this, the ladder is still programmed to transport the player and would place them next to the [[spirit tree]] near the [[Battlefield]].

